# This directory starts empty on purpose.
#
# Task T05 has to create the workspace's first knowhow entry, and task T06
# measures whether it is found again. A seeded entry would answer both.
#
# Git cannot track an empty directory, so this file exists only to carry the
# directory into the fixture. It is not a knowhow entry: the loader reads
# `.md` files, and this is neither.
